AWS_CLI_Commands (Production Focus) (0–3 Years DevOps Engineer)

These AWS CLI commands are commonly used in real production environments…

Useful for automation, scripting, and quick troubleshooting 👇

🔹 General

1. aws help → CLI help  
2. aws configure → Configure credentials  
3. aws configure list → View config  
4. aws sts get-caller-identity → Check active user  
5. aws --version → CLI version  

🔹 EC2 (Compute)

6. aws ec2 describe-instances → List instances  
7. aws ec2 start-instances --instance-ids <id>  
8. aws ec2 stop-instances --instance-ids <id>  
9. aws ec2 reboot-instances --instance-ids <id>  
10. aws ec2 terminate-instances --instance-ids <id>  
11. aws ec2 describe-security-groups  
12. aws ec2 describe-key-pairs  

🔹 S3 (Storage)

13. aws s3 ls → List buckets  
14. aws s3 mb s3://bucket-name → Create bucket  
15. aws s3 rb s3://bucket-name → Delete bucket  
16. aws s3 cp file s3://bucket/ → Upload file  
17. aws s3 sync . s3://bucket/ → Sync folder  
18. aws s3 rm s3://bucket/file → Delete file  

🔹 IAM (Security)

19. aws iam list-users  
20. aws iam create-user --user-name <name>  
21. aws iam delete-user --user-name <name>  
22. aws iam list-roles  
23. aws iam list-policies  

🔹 CloudWatch (Monitoring)

24. aws logs describe-log-groups  
25. aws logs tail <log-group> --follow  
26. aws cloudwatch list-metrics  
27. aws cloudwatch describe-alarms  

🔹 RDS (Database)

28. aws rds describe-db-instances  
29. aws rds start-db-instance --db-instance-identifier <id>  
30. aws rds stop-db-instance --db-instance-identifier <id>  

🔹 VPC & Networking

31. aws ec2 describe-vpcs  
32. aws ec2 describe-subnets  
33. aws ec2 describe-route-tables  
34. aws ec2 describe-internet-gateways  

🔹 ECR (Container Registry)

35. aws ecr get-login-password  
36. aws ecr describe-repositories  
37. aws ecr create-repository --repository-name <name>  

🔹 ECS / EKS (Containers)

38. aws ecs list-clusters  
39. aws ecs list-tasks  
40. aws eks list-clusters  

💡 These commands are part of daily AWS operations in DevOps environments
